        "1. Add a module-level helper `dropInvalidArrowheadSize = <T extends ExcalidrawLinearElement>(element: T): T` that returns the element unchanged when it has no `arrowheadSize` key or `isArrowheadSize(element.arrowheadSize)` is true; otherwise returns a shallow copy without the key (destructure it out; no mutation, no `delete` on the input).",
